    "preamble": "Syed Shabbir S/O Syed Mir vs State Of Mah. Thr. Pso Ps Akot File Akola ... on 23 August, 2021",
    "facts": "3. It is alleged that article namely sweet supari worth Rs. 2,880/- was seized from the shop owned by the applicant. It is argued that procedure under Section 42 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 has not been followed. Moreover, the question about applicability of notification and the provisions of Act are also canvassed. In the circumstances, it is necessary to to go through the chemical analysis report.",
